author ai
group tooling
note cargo xtask parity [scenario]: finds the parent revision (jj log -r @- if jj answers, else git rev-parse HEAD), builds it once from a git archive into target/parity/source with CARGO_TARGET_DIR=target/parity/build, caches the release binary at target/parity/bin/<commit>/codemap, then runs cargo test --release --test parity -- --ignored with CODEMAP_BASE_BIN and CODEMAP_PARITY_REV set (and CODEMAP_PARITY_ONLY when a scenario is named), and prints the scenarios whose output differs.

