symbol git_store
lines 0 4
hash a9a267b47dcf9909
note The repository's git store, from jj git root: the .git of a colocated checkout, or the store every jj workspace shares, so a workspace with no .git of its own can still archive a revision. git archive takes it as --git-dir; the test gets it as CODEMAP_PARITY_GIT_DIR for its own snapshot of the repo. None when jj does not answer, and git then looks for a repository from the working directory.

